        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 65.28,
          "end": 68.78999999999999,
          "en": "Otherwise, if the user did press the calculate button,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 68.78999999999999,
          "end": 72.423,
          "en": "I wanna output a table with that investment data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 73.53,
          "end": 76.24,
          "en": "For that, I'll give that table a head",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 78.66,
          "end": 83.28,
          "en": "with my different column headings like year,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 83.28,
          "end": 88.28,
          "en": "investment value, interest for the given year,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 90.99,
          "end": 93.003,
          "en": "total interest,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 93.96000000000001,
          "end": 96.63,
          "en": "and invested capital.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 96.63,
          "end": 99.843,
          "en": "These are the headings for my columns.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 102.15,
          "end": 105.47999999999999,
          "en": "And that of course is the data we are deriving here in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 105.47999999999999,
          "end": 106.71000000000001,
          "en": "that annual data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 106.71000000000001,
          "end": 109.053,
          "en": "So that's all that data we already got.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 110.64,
          "end": 113.7,
          "en": "But then below the heading, I want to have the table body.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 113.7,
          "end": 117.99000000000001,
          "en": "And here I now want to dynamically output as many table rows",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 117.99000000000001,
          "end": 121.14,
          "en": "as needed because of course, I don't know in advance",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 121.14,
          "end": 124.59,
          "en": "for how many years the user wants to calculate that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 124.59,
          "end": 129.57,
          "en": "Maybe they just wanna calculate for one year, maybe for 100.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 129.57,
          "end": 131.22,
          "en": "I don't know it in advance.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 131.22,
          "end": 135.99,
          "en": "So we need some dynamic code here to output those rows.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 135.99,
          "end": 139.86,
          "en": "Now, before we can add that code though, we must make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 139.86,
          "end": 143.553,
          "en": "that we get those results into this component so",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 143.553,
          "end": 146.22,
          "en": "that we have them available here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 146.22,
          "end": 150.27,
          "en": "And we can achieve that by accepting an input,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 150.27,
          "end": 154.77,
          "en": "a bindable property that's exposed by this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 154.77,
          "end": 156.72,
          "en": "to its parent component so",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 156.72,
          "end": 161.7,
          "en": "that the parent component can pass data into this component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 161.7,
          "end": 164.64,
          "en": "And here for accepting such input data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 164.64,
          "end": 167.7,
          "en": "we again got two approaches.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 167.7,
          "end": 170.34,
          "en": "Both start by adding a property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 170.34,
          "end": 172.803,
          "en": "that should be settable from outside.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 173.88,
          "end": 176.04,
          "en": "And it could be named results here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 176.04,
          "end": 177.49,
          "en": "though the name is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 178.8,
          "end": 183.39,
          "en": "Then you could turn this into an input by assigning a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 183.39,
          "end": 187.56,
          "en": "where the value is the result of calling the input function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 187.56,
          "end": 191.313,
          "en": "with a lowercase I imported from Angular core.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 193.08,
          "end": 197.31,
          "en": "This registers this as an input to be precise",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 197.31,
          "end": 201.153,
          "en": "as a signal input, so using signals.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 202.68,
          "end": 203.97,
          "en": "Now that would be one way.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 203.97,
          "end": 206.13,
          "en": "The other way would be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 206.13,
          "end": 209.37,
          "en": "to not assign a value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 209.37,
          "end": 212.25,
          "en": "but instead to add a decorator in front of it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 212.25,
          "end": 216.36,
          "en": "the input decorator with an uppercase eye,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 216.36,
          "end": 219.303,
          "en": "which is also imported from Angular core.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 221.85,
          "end": 226.44,
          "en": "Now, we also need to set the type of data we expect here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 226.44,
          "end": 228.72,
          "en": "and I'll do that in just a second.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 228.72,
          "end": 232.2,
          "en": "We also would need to do that on the input function though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 232.2,
          "end": 234.603,
          "en": "with help of angle brackets like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 235.68,
          "end": 239.19,
          "en": "But what is the type of data we expect to get here?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 239.19,
          "end": 242.43,
          "en": "Well, it's in the end, the shape",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 242.43,
          "end": 247.38,
          "en": "of these annual results here, the annual data here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 247.38,
          "end": 250.17,
          "en": "It will be an array full of objects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 250.17,
          "end": 252.96,
          "en": "where every object has this shape.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 252.96,
          "end": 256.35,
          "en": "So an object that has a year property, interest property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 256.35,
          "end": 257.763,
          "en": "and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 258.96,
          "end": 262.473,
          "en": "So what I'll do is I'll copy this code here, this object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 263.67,
          "end": 267.24,
          "en": "and go back to my investment results",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 267.24,
          "end": 269.73,
          "en": "and use that here though, of course like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 269.73,
          "end": 273.33,
          "en": "it's not a type, I need to replace the part",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 273.33,
          "end": 276.21,
          "en": "after the colon here with valid types.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 276.21,
          "end": 279.12,
          "en": "So here, for example, should be a number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 279.12,
          "end": 281.04,
          "en": "The interest should be a number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 281.04,
          "end": 283.40999999999997,
          "en": "The value at the end of the year should be a number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 283.40999999999997,
          "end": 285.21,
          "en": "The annual investment should be a number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 285.21,
          "end": 287.01,
          "en": "The total interest should be a number,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 287.01,
          "end": 289.26,
          "en": "and the total amount invested should be a number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 289.26,
          "end": 290.913,
          "en": "So pretty straightforward.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 293.64,
          "end": 296.61,
          "en": "And that's also the type you would use here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 296.61,
          "end": 299.1,
          "en": "between those angle brackets by the way,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 299.1,
          "end": 302.22,
          "en": "if you were using this input function instead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 302.22,
          "end": 304.293,
          "en": "of this approach here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 305.85,
          "end": 308.1,
          "en": "Now you'll see that I'll still get an error here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 308.1,
          "end": 312.633,
          "en": "because I have no initial value assigned to results.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 314.01,
          "end": 315.21,
          "en": "So what we can do here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 315.21,
          "end": 319.26,
          "en": "to fix this problem is either add a question mark here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 319.26,
          "end": 321.93,
          "en": "after the property name to tell TypeScript",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 321.93,
          "end": 324.03,
          "en": "that this is an optional property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 324.03,
          "end": 326.49,
          "en": "which might have this value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 326.49,
          "end": 329.04,
          "en": "or a value of this type to be precise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 329.04,
          "end": 331.323,
          "en": "but which might also be undefined.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 332.46,
          "end": 335.64,
          "en": "Or we add an exclamation mark to tell TypeScript",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 335.64,
          "end": 340.40999999999997,
          "en": "that this will always be a value of this shape here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 340.40999999999997,
          "end": 343.47,
          "en": "Now here a question mark seems more appropriate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 343.47,
          "end": 347.46,
          "en": "because of course if the user hasn't clicked calculate yet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 347.46,
          "end": 349.8,
          "en": "we won't have any results yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 349.8,
          "end": 351.96,
          "en": "And therefore it makes sense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 351.96,
          "end": 355.8,
          "en": "that this investment results component might be displayed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 355.8,
          "end": 359.31,
          "en": "without any results being available.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 359.31,
          "end": 362.22,
          "en": "So that's how I'll set this up here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 362.22,
          "end": 364.83,
          "en": "Now with the input added, we can go back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 364.83,
          "end": 369.48,
          "en": "to the app component, to the app component template,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 369.48,
          "end": 374.48,
          "en": "and use our app investment results component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 374.76,
          "end": 378.9,
          "en": "Of course, it's not available yet, so we need to import it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 378.9,
          "end": 382.23,
          "en": "and add it to this imports array on the app component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 382.23,
          "end": 383.67,
          "en": "But with it, it is available.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 383.67,
          "end": 388.67,
          "en": "And with that we can then also bind this results property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 389.73,
          "end": 394.23,
          "en": "Though it's also fine if we would pass some undefined",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 394.23,
          "end": 396.73,
          "en": "value as an initial value here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 397.77,
          "end": 399.84000000000003,
          "en": "because thanks to this question mark,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 399.84000000000003,
          "end": 402.42,
          "en": "that is a value we anticipate here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 402.42,
          "end": 404.493,
          "en": "in the investment results component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 406.08,
          "end": 409.14,
          "en": "But either way, at the moment, I got nothing to pass",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 409.14,
          "end": 412.17,
          "en": "to the app investment results component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 412.17,
          "end": 414.27,
          "en": "from inside the app component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 414.27,
          "end": 417.33,
          "en": "because in the app component TypeScript file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 417.33,
          "end": 419.49,
          "en": "I'm calculating the annual data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 419.49,
          "end": 422.91,
          "en": "but I'm then just logging it to the console,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 422.91,
          "end": 425.85,
          "en": "which is not that helpful.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 425.85,
          "end": 427.62,
          "en": "In order to make it available",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 427.62,
          "end": 429.9,
          "en": "to the app component template so",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 429.9,
          "end": 432.75,
          "en": "that we can then there use it as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 432.75,
          "end": 434.52,
          "en": "for some property binding,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 434.52,
          "end": 439.52,
          "en": "for example, I have to store that annual data in a property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 439.53,
          "end": 440.823,
          "en": "of the app component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 442.23,
          "end": 445.89,
          "en": "So here I'll add a results data property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 445.89,
          "end": 448.38,
          "en": "The name of course is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
